a.concept(4,'s03','ABG5-S03','One Surface, bounded local correction and truthful blocking.')
a.constraint(4,'s03_progression_and_stop',['s03'],'One public invocation proves GTL orders synthesizeModel->evalGap->evaluateNext->intent admission->invoke/continue->evidence admission->evaluateAction, refreshing model/gap/lawful-next/action truth after admitted evidence. Observe truthful stop/hold/gap and replay frontier; prove bounded correction under existing authority with automatic progress/evidence refresh/unaffected work to declared completion. Absence of lawful next step yields typed block/handoff, not false completion. SDK/CLI/fixture/worker do not order the loop. Exercise retained consequences/dispositions including local span re-entry and explicitly defer allocated portions. Native human response and F12/S04 are not S03 gates.')
a.concept(5,'s04','ABG5-S04','Reserved 5.1 dedicated reflection/tuning scenario, whose frozen design requires release-boundary reconciliation before realization.')
a.constraint(5,'s04_deferred_not_self_conformance',['s04','self_conformance'],'Uses same governance/replay/recursive investigation/parent re-evaluation plus drafts/attribution/ratification/rejection; negative proof refuses authority expansion from visibility or child success. Deferral does not defer/weaken/merge mandatory F11 self-conformance.')
a.concept(6,'s05','ABG5-S05','Reserved 5.1 Consensus free-construction scenario; preserved code/smoke test is not completed qualification.')
a.constraint(6,'s05_future_obligation',['s05'],'Invoke packed SYSTEM Consensus through ordinary catalog/CLI over one real ticket with at least two differently attributed reviewer profiles. Prove agreement closure, dispute recursion, bounded-round/unresolved-dispute F_H handoff across existing/alternate/temporary workspaces; typed replay-derived results/continuations, no shell orchestration/ticket mutation. Native response/resume after handoff belongs to 5.1.',conditions=['Dedicated S05 qualification is selected for its reserved 5.1 scope.'])
a.concept(7,'s06','ABG5-S06','Native/downstream portability and complete prospectively selected specification-driven lifecycle witness.')
a.constraint(7,'s06_complete_witness',['s06','downstream_lifecycle'],'Native SDK/CLI invocation needs no marketplace; parity is reserved. Selected default/user-function composition carries exact original source and prospective contract through Intent/Product, Requirements, Design, working behavior, admitted executable/semantic evidence and consequential revision using only installed Public contracts. Retain predecessor/source identities, all applicable/new obligations, roles and residuals. Admitted semantic assessments establish meaning under own authority; total deterministic checks establish identity/roles/currentness/coverage/closure eligibility, not owner rulings. Weaker agreeing code/tests leave stronger obligations open. Failed checks/changed requirements create replay-visible pressure and affected invalidation; re-entry within admitted scope uses declared stages, external entry requires F_H. Repair/continuation preserve unaffected work and obligations. Full selected witness requires all mandatory outcomes, applicable independent semantics and admitted executable evidence; first behavior/correction, residuals or test counts alone are insufficient. Original T-043 Data Mapper evaluation and downstream publication remain separately owned, may stop incomplete and are not erased by witness acceptance.')
a.constraint(7,'s06_registered_choice_discriminator',['s06'],'Default-library proof uses independent minimal application/oracle through clean installed sandbox/Public entry; live LLM produces files, executed checks, selected UAT and fresh admitted readback. Production source/package contain no solution, contract, publication, result or dispatch branch. Distinguish fresh/reusable/counterevidence work. At least one prospective counterevidence case must cause a different preregistered function choice within Program, retaining catalog/purpose/reason/actual admission: artifact-only repair on universal unchanged route fails. Unchanged choice is lawful where justified elsewhere; missing suitable capability stays gap, not graph generation. Show frame/criterion and closed-rule-versus-F_P differences governing declared choice, unknown required input gap, recursive investigation/foldback without lost parent obligations. Separate copy/install, pre-actor runtime, LLM, deterministic work and readback costs. These are S02/S03/S06 discriminators, not replacement for complete F17 witness.')
